<!--
  RM_LongShade_Bodies.xml                   LONGSHADE_RULED_CONTENT_1, Q1

  The great devourer's and mature fleshbeast's own custom BodyDefs (moved from
  src/RimStarWars/SWBestiary/Defs/Bodies/RSW_AADesertPort_Bodies.xml,
  RSW_WormWithArmor -> RM_GreatDevourerBody and RSW_TentacledQuadrupedEyeless
  -> RM_MatureFleshbeastBody) plus the small BodyPartDefs each one owns
  exclusively (the worm's four body segments, the echolocation organ shared
  only between these two bodies, the tentacle part used six times by the
  fleshbeast) — verified none of these six parts is referenced by any other
  body anywhere in src/RimStarWars before moving them. Every other part tag
  both bodies use (SnakeBody, SnakeHead, Body, Head, Leg, Paw, HeadAttackTool,
  Teeth, Arms, FrontLeftPaw, FrontRightPaw, and the internal organs) is
  vanilla Core and needed no change.
-->
